      "writtenOn": "2013-12-11T23:44:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This functionality doesn\u0027t appear to exist anywhere except in the LPC implementation (return the 1-based index of the next event bit).\n\nI\u0027m not sure how to abstract it so that this works correctly on all ECs. CONFIG_ACPI? CONFIG_LPC? something else?",
